            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Cleopatra's Early Life</strong><br>\nCleopatra VII was born in 69 BC in Alexandria, Egypt. She was not actually Egyptian but of Macedonian descent, belonging to the Ptolemaic dynasty that had ruled Egypt since Alexander the Great's general Ptolemy I took control. Cleopatra was known for her intelligence and ability to speak several languages. She became queen at the age of 18 after her father's death and co-ruled with her younger brother, whom she married as was customary in the dynasty.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Rise to Power</strong><br>\nCleopatra's rise to power was not smooth. Early in her reign, she faced challenges that led to her expulsion from the throne. But she was determined to reclaim her position. In 48 BC, she aligned herself with Julius Caesar of Rome, which helped her regain the throne. Their alliance was not only political but also became romantic, and they had a son named Ptolemy Caesar, known as Caesarion.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Cleopatra and Caesar's Alliance</strong><br>\nCleopatra's relationship with Caesar was a turning point for Egypt's fortunes. She spent time in Rome as an ally to Caesar and represented her kingdom with great dignity. After Caesar's assassination in 44 BC, Cleopatra returned to Egypt, where she co-ruled with her young son. Her influence and power were significant as she continued to solidify her son's future as her co-ruler.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
